    "poster_id": 1598,
    "post_rendered": "If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\"  width=\"57\" height=\"13\" > is a cyclic quadrilateral, then prove that the incenters of the triangles <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\"  width=\"42\" height=\"13\" >,</span> <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/a/d7ada763e99852a6e44a15d46cce3c3709a944d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCD$\"  width=\"44\" height=\"12\" >,</span> <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/c/17ccf9ac51faa912a5338f4ebde95b5d3a0f7fb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CDA$\"  width=\"43\" height=\"13\" >,</span> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/9/1e94f1abd32d37d04a5b77e333689bf70ef83864.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DAB$\"  width=\"43\" height=\"13\" > are the vertices of a rectangle.",
    "post_canonical": "If $ABCD$ is a cyclic quadrilateral, then prove that the incenters of the triangles $ABC$, $BCD$, $CDA$, $DAB$ are the vertices of a rectangle.",
